只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH Web plugin: message-level full-text search + timeline visualization for sessions.","id":"gh:1344558246","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-session-explorer","slug":"Zn-Dk/dsh-session-explorer","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH Web plugin: message-level full-text search + timeline visualization for sessions."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-explorer"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DSH Web plugin: message-level full-text search across sessions. Search a specific message (user / as"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"sistant / tool / system-injected), preview context read-only, and jump to the real session with one "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"t / tool / system-injected), preview context read-only, and jump to the real session with one click."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Message-level full-text search** — user / assistant / system-injected text at high weight, tool "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"name / arguments / error summary at low weight. FTS5 trigram index supports arbitrary substrings wit"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"hout Chinese tokenization; queries shorter than 3 characters fall back to LIKE matching.\n- **Four me"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ssage kinds** — user / assistant / steering (plugin-injected prompts, skill-catalog, skill-invocatio"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"n, compaction summaries, …) / tool (tool name, arguments and error summary searchable).\n- **Deduplic"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ated results across fork/continued sessions** — fork/continuation sessions share parent history, so "},{"id":"p6s7","text":"the same message is stored once per session; search groups by (seq, kind, text) and keeps the sessio"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"n with a non-empty title and the latest index time.\n- **Read-only preview** — focused hit plus a sur"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"rounding context window; the focus message auto-scrolls to the center of the viewport, and one click"},{"id":"p6s10","text":" opens it in the real session.\n- **Session browser entry** — sidebar tool entry + an overlay panel i"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"nside the conversation column (no global overlay); the top-left \"back to session\" button closes the "},{"id":"p6s12","text":"panel.\n- **Searchable session overview** — CSS Grid cards with metadata, first/latest message summar"},{"id":"p6s13","text":"ies, main/subagent filtering, text search, and sorting. Clicking a card opens an in-place message su"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"mmary detail; it does not depend on original-session anchor jumping.\n- **i18n** — full zh/en coverag"},{"id":"p6s15","text":"e (panel / dialogs / search / preview); language follows the DSH Host locale service (instant switch"},{"id":"p6s16","text":" in Settings → General), no manual setting needed.\n- **Rebuild (incremental / full + health check)**"},{"id":"p6s17","text":" — incremental mode fast-diffs via engine revision tokens (O(1) skip), re-flushes changed sessions b"},{"id":"p6s18","text":"y content fingerprint and removes ghost sessions; full mode resets the database and rebuilds session"},{"id":"p6s19","text":" by session. The rebuild dialog runs a health check (integrity + table readability) and recommends a"},{"id":"p6s20","text":" mode.\n- **Index status (corrupted-session classification)** — indexed / stale / failed (source log "},{"id":"p6s21","text":"corrupted, not indexable); opening the panel triggers a light sync (live + not-yet-indexed sessions)"},{"id":"p6s22","text":", turn end syncs incrementally, and startup reconciles."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### From npm (recommended)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Package page: https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-session-explorer"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Build from source"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"After installation, restart `dsh web`; the \"Session Explorer\" entry appears in the sidebar tool area"},{"id":"p13s2","text":". The index lives at `~/.dsh/storages/session-explorer.sqlite` (auto-created and indexed on first us"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"he index lives at `~/.dsh/storages/session-explorer.sqlite` (auto-created and indexed on first use)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- `src/protocol.ts` — RPC contract types (shared Host/Client)\n- `src/transcript.ts` — SessionEvent l"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"og → indexable message entries, pure fold layer (zero deps, unit-testable)\n- `src/indexer.ts` — SQLi"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"te FTS5 trigram derived index (host side, application_id + user_version dual check, 0600 perms)\n- `s"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"rc/rpc.ts` — RPC validation and routing\n- `src/index.ts` — host assembly (event sync + RPC + startup"},{"id":"p17s5","text":" reconciliation)\n- `src/client/` — browser bundle (sidebar entry + search/preview views + conversati"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"on-column overlay panel)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- Full tool-result body full-text search is deferred to V2 (only tool name / args / error summary en"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ter the low-weight field today).\n- Session deletion has no engine API; index cleanup only covers the"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" plugin's own database.\n- The timeline canvas (@xyflow/react) has a serious rendering bug; the entry"},{"id":"p19s4","text":" is hidden since 0.2.0 and will return once fixed."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"See the `assets/` directory for installation, search, and timeline overview screenshots, and `screen"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"shots.json` for the curated list the dsh-market uses to render the marketplace card preview."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Release & listing"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- npm package: dsh-session-explorer\n- GitHub Releases: Releases page\n- Listed in:\n- awesome-dsh-plug"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"in (main channel, `data/plugins/Zn-Dk__dsh-session-explorer.yml`)\n- 0xsline/awesome-deepseek-harness"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" (README + README.zh-CN)\n- AdamPlatin123/awesome-dsh-plugins (PLUGINS.md)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
